  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks and cauliflower into small florets.\n• Place potato and cauliflower on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with brown mustard seeds and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6728199e16186c0f34b4f63e-76fdb649.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn.\n• Grate carrot, squeezing out any excess moisture with a paper towel.\n• Thinly slice brown onion.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Slice lime into wedges. TIP: Removing excess liquid from the veggies will help the fritters crisp up in the pan!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6728199e16186c0f34b4f63e-a5c5acdf.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine the egg, sweetcorn, carrot, onion, garlic, Mumbai spice blend, Cheddar cheese, plain flour and milk. TIP: Lift out some of the mixture with a spoon, if it's too wet and doesn't hold its shape, add a little more flour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6728199e16186c0f34b4f63e-82d437a7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of fritter mixture, in batches, flattening with a spatula. Cook until golden, 3-4 minutes each side (don't flip too early!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. You should get 3-4 fritters per person. TIP: Add extra olive oil between batches as needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6728199e16186c0f34b4f63e-9e732d77.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the fritters are cooking, pick and finely slice mint leaves.\n• In a small bowl, combine mint and Greek-style yoghurt. Season to taste. Set aside.\n• To the veggie tray, add baby spinach leaves and a squeeze of lime juice. Toss to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6728199e16186c0f34b4f63e-ab144a61.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide cheesy Mumbai corn fritters and bombay potato-cauliflower toss between plates.\n• Sprinkle over pepitas.\n• Serve with mint yoghurt and any remaining lime wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6728199e16186c0f34b4f63e-21fa02d8.jpeg"
    }
  ]
